sequenceDiagram
    title User Registration with Validation

    actor User
    participant Auth as Auth API
    participant Email as Email Svc
    participant DB as Users DB

    User->>Auth: POST /register {name, email, password}
    activate Auth
    Auth->>Auth: validateInput()
    Note right: Check email format,<br/>password strength,<br/>name length

    Auth->>DB: findUser(email)
    activate DB
    DB-->>Auth: null
    deactivate DB

    Auth->>Auth: hashPassword()
    Auth->>DB: createUser(record)
    activate DB
    DB-->>Auth: userId
    deactivate DB

    Auth->>Email: sendWelcome(email, name)
    activate Email
    Email-->>Auth: sent
    deactivate Email

    Auth-->>User: 201 Created {userId}
    deactivate Auth
